<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειχήν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆνος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tree-moss, lichen</i>, implied in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειχηνιάω</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>liver-wort</i>, that grows on damp rocks, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.53
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππειος λ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππολειχήν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				945
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a
				<i>lichen-like eruption</i> on the skin of animals, esp. on
			the chin, <i>mentagra</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				281
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.20
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sud.</u>
				14
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				21.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				8.16
			</span></i>; also, of the ground, <i>blight, canker</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				785
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in
			horses, the normal <i>callosity on foreleg, chestnut</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.43
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Cael.Aur.
				<u>TP</u>
				1.138
			</span></i> (pl.).—In codd. freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιχήν</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
